## 10. Convoys (pipeline planning)

<!-- Delete this entire section if only L1 was installed (no L2 roles, no .convoys/). -->

Pipeline planning uses **convoy files** at `.convoys/<slug>.md` — not Cursor's native Plan files at `.cursor/plans/`.

- **Start new work:** invoke `role-conductor` — *"Start a new convoy: [idea]. Success = [metric]."*
- **Format spec:** [`.convoys/README.md`](.convoys/README.md)
- **Role pipeline:** [`docs/role-reference.md`](docs/role-reference.md) (or `docs/agent-context/role-reference.md` if that's where pipeline docs live)
- **Rule:** [`.cursor/rules/convoy-planning.mdc`](.cursor/rules/convoy-planning.mdc)

Do not create `.cursor/plans/` files for convoy or L2-role work. If Plan mode produced one by mistake, migrate the content into `.convoys/<slug>.md` or discard it.
